Prove the agent's rtok MCP server is alive and answering

Usage: rtok mcp ping [OPTIONS] [AGENT]

Arguments:
  [AGENT]  Host (`claude`, `cursor`, …); omitted checks every host with MCP installed

Options:
      --cli             Only the CLI app
      --config <PATH>   User config file (else `RTOK_CONFIG` or `<home>/config.toml`)
      --desktop         Only the desktop app
      --timeout <SECS>  Seconds to wait for the agent or the server [default: 60]
      --json            One JSON object per host
  -h, --help            Print help
